+        // 4) Strip null/empty values from every JSON-LD node (added 2026-07-16).
+        //
+        //    THE ACTUAL CAUSE of the ~375 "Schema.org validation error" pages.
+        //    Schema Pro emits the sitewide FinancialService node with its
